   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOD402 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.2</span>\n<h2>Grading: every mark and its weight</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Read this in week one — part of the grade is earned in class long before any exam.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 14447 · Decision 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 21/08/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">HOD402 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.2</span>\n<h2>Cách tính điểm: đủ mọi đầu điểm và trọng số</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đọc ngay tuần đầu — một phần điểm được tính trong lớp từ rất sớm, trước mọi kỳ thi.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 14447 · QĐ 1028/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 21/08/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Category<br><small>Đầu điểm</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Parts<br><small>Số phần</small></th><th>Weight<br><small>Trọng số</small></th><th>Completion criteria<br><small>Điều kiện hoàn thành</small></th><th>Duration<br><small>Thời lượng</small></th><th>CLO</th><th>Question type<br><small>Dạng câu hỏi</small></th><th>No. of questions<br><small>Số câu</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>LAB</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>12</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60'</td><td>CLO1-CLO10</td><td>Home work, class</td><td>1</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Progress test 1</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>10.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>10'-30'</td><td>CLO1-CLO5</td><td>Multiple choices<br>Marked by Computer or a suitable format</td><td>30</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Progress test 2</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>10.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>10'-30'</td><td>CLO6-CLO10</td><td>Multiple choices<br>Marked by Computer or a suitable format</td><td>30</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Project</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60'</td><td>CLO1-CLO10</td><td>Home work, class</td><td>1</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>Final exam</strong></td><td>Final exam</td><td>1</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60'</td><td></td><td>Multiple choices<br>Marked by Computer</td><td>50</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The weights add up to <strong>100%</strong>. Minimum average to pass: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>How to read \"Completion criteria\":</em> it is the minimum score that one mark must reach (e.g. <code>&gt;0</code> = you must not get zero / must sit it; <code>4</code> = at least 4/10). Missing it can mean failing the subject even with a good average — this reading is the website's explanation, the table itself is the university's.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tổng trọng số đúng <strong>100%</strong>. Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua môn: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>Cách đọc cột \"Điều kiện hoàn thành\":</em> là điểm tối thiểu đầu điểm đó phải đạt (vd <code>&gt;0</code> = không được 0 / phải dự; <code>4</code> = tối thiểu 4/10). Không đạt có thể trượt môn dù điểm trung bình cao — phần giải thích này là của web, bảng là của trường.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>The fine print per mark (verbatim)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LAB</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> - cover content 5,6,7,8<br><em>Grading guide:</em> each lab focuses on the session topic</li>\n<li><strong>Progress test 1</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> - cover content 1,2,3,4,5<br><em>Grading guide:</em> in class, by instructor<br><em>Note:</em> Instruction and shedules for Progress tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>Progress test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has resposibility to review the test for students after graded.</li>\n<li><strong>Progress test 2</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> - cover content 6,7,8,9,10<br><em>Grading guide:</em> in class, by instructor<br><em>Note:</em> Instruction and shedules for Progress tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>Progress test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has resposibility to review the test for students after graded.</li>\n<li><strong>Project</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> - costudents' active learning attitude during the course;<br>discipline and communication<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Each group receives a research topic and reports at the end of the term</li>\n<li><strong>Final exam</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Studied all of course's Material<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Studied all of course's Material</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Chi tiết từng đầu điểm (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>LAB</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> - cover content 5,6,7,8<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> each lab focuses on the session topic</li>\n<li><strong>Progress test 1</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> - cover content 1,2,3,4,5<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> in class, by instructor<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> Instruction and shedules for Progress tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>Progress test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has resposibility to review the test for students after graded.</li>\n<li><strong>Progress test 2</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> - cover content 6,7,8,9,10<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> in class, by instructor<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> Instruction and shedules for Progress tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>Progress test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has resposibility to review the test for students after graded.</li>\n<li><strong>Project</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> - costudents' active learning attitude during the course;<br>discipline and communication<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Each group receives a research topic and reports at the end of the term</li>\n<li><strong>Final exam</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Studied all of course's Material<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Studied all of course's Material</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14447</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=14447</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
